  "type": "html-template",
  "original": {
    "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>立夏时节 | 回望北京的春天</title>\n</head>\n\n<body>\n    <section\n        style=\"padding: 0; margin: 0; font-family: 'PingFang SC', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif; background: linear-gradient(to bottom, #f9f9f9, #ffffff); color: #333; line-height: 1.6; max-width: 100%; overflow-x: hidden;\">\n\n        <!-- 封面区域 -->\n        <section\n            style=\"height: 100vh; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f5e3e6 0%, #d9e4f5 100%); padding: 32px; box-sizing: border-box;\">\n            <section style=\"margin-bottom: 32px;\">\n                <h1\n                    style=\"font-size: 35.2px; font-weight: 900; margin: 0; letter-spacing: -0.5px; line-height: 1.2; color: #222;\">\n                    立夏时节</h1>\n                <h2 style=\"font-size: 28.8px; font-weight: 700; margin: 8px 0 0; color: #444; line-height: 1.3;\">\n                    用66张图带你回望<br>北京的春天</h2>\n            </section>\n\n            <section style=\"margin: 24px 0;\">\n                <svg width=\"100%\" height=\"80\" viewBox=\"0 0 300 80\">\n                    <path d=\"M10,40 Q150,10 290,40\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#d88c9a\" stroke-width=\"2\">\n                        <animate attributeName=\"d\" from=\"M10,40 Q150,10 290,40\" to=\"M10,40 Q150,70 290,40\" dur=\"3s\"\n                            repeatCount=\"indefinite\" />\n                    </path>\n                    <circle cx=\"150\" cy=\"40\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#d88c9a\">\n                        <animate attributeName=\"cy\" from=\"25\" to=\"55\" dur=\"3s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" />\n                    </circle>\n                </svg>\n            </section>\n\n            <section style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #666; letter-spacing: 1px; font-weight: 300;\">\n                SPRING IN BEIJING · 2025\n            </section>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- 引言部分 -->\n        <section\n            style=\"padding: 40px 24px; background-color: #fff; box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); border-radius: 20px; margin: -16px 16px 24px; position: relative; z-index: 10;\">\n            <h3\n                style=\"font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; color: #333; margin: 0 0 16px; border-left: 4px solid #d88c9a; padding-left: 12.8px;\">\n                引言：立夏与春天的告别</h3>\n\n            <p\n                style=\"font-size: 16.8px; line-height: 1.8; color: #444; margin: 0 0 16px; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">\n                立夏已至，春意渐远。在这个充满希望的季节里，我们用66张照片记录下北京春天的每一个美好瞬间。从早春的萌动到暮春的温柔，每一帧都是这座城市对春天的深情告白。</p>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- 早春的萌动 -->\n        <section\n            style=\"margin: 0 16px 32px; background-color: #fcfcfc; border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(216,140,154,0.08);\">\n            <section style=\"background-color: #f0f5fa; padding: 28.8px; border-radius: 16px 16px 0 0;\">\n                <h3\n                    style=\"font-size: 25.6px; font-weight: 800; margin: 0; color: #333; display: flex; align-items: center;\">\n                    <span\n                        style=\"display: inline-block; width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; background-color: #d88c9a; margin-right: 12.8px; flex-shrink: 0; color: white; font-size: 16px; text-align: center; line-height: 30px;\">1</span>\n                    早春的萌动\n                </h3>\n                <p style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #666; margin: 8px 0 0 41.6px; font-style: italic;\">The First Touch of\n                    Spring</p>\n            </section>\n\n            <section style=\"padding: 24px; background: white;\">\n                <section style=\"margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n                    <h4\n                        style=\"font-size: 19.2px; font-weight: 700; color: #444; margin: 0 0 16px; border-bottom: 1px dashed #eee; padding-bottom: 8px;\">\n                        二月春风似剪刀：北京的第一抹绿意</h4>\n                    <p style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7; margin: 0 0 16px; text-indent: 2em; color: #555;\">\n                        颐和园的冰雪初融，玉渊潭的早樱悄然绽放。胡同里的初绿与风筝，勾勒出早春的生机。</p>\n\n                    <section\n                        style=\"margin: 24px 0; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);\">\n                        <img src=\"https://picsum.photos/600/350?random=1\" alt=\"北京早春风光\"\n                            style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; border-radius: 12px;\">\n                        <section\n                            style=\"padding: 12.8px; background: #f9f9f9; font-size: 13.6px; color: #777; text-align: center;\">\n                            颐和园·昆明湖冰雪初融（2月中旬）</section>\n                    </section>\n                </section>\n\n                <section>\n                    <h4\n                        style=\"font-size: 19.2px; font-weight: 700; color: #444; margin: 24px 0 16px; border-bottom: 1px dashed #eee; padding-bottom: 8px;\">\n                        樱花与红墙：古都的浪漫碰撞</h4>\n                    <p style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7; margin: 0 0 16px; text-indent: 2em; color: #555;\">\n                        故宫的海棠与红墙相映成趣，元都遗址的\"海棠花溪\"如诗如画。</p>\n                </section>\n            </section>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- 盛春的绚烂 -->\n        <section\n            style=\"margin: 0 16px 32px; background-color: #fcfcfc; border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(216,140,154,0.08);\">\n            <section style=\"background-color: #f5e6e9; padding: 28.8px; border-radius: 16px 16px 0 0;\">\n                <h3\n                    style=\"font-size: 25.6px; font-weight: 800; margin: 0; color: #333; display: flex; align-items: center;\">\n                    <span\n                        style=\"display: inline-block; width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; background-color: #d88c9a; margin-right: 12.8px; flex-shrink: 0; color: white; font-size: 16px; text-align: center; line-height: 30px;\">2</span>\n                    盛春的绚烂\n                </h3>\n                <p style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #666; margin: 8px 0 0 41.6px; font-style: italic;\">The Blooming Season\n                </p>\n            </section>\n\n            <section style=\"padding: 24px; background: white;\">\n                <section style=\"margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n                    <h4\n                        style=\"font-size: 19.2px; font-weight: 700; color: #444; margin: 0 0 16px; border-bottom: 1px dashed #eee; padding-bottom: 8px;\">\n                        满城尽带花海棠：京城的春日高潮</h4>\n\n                    <section style=\"display: flex; margin: 24px 0; gap: 10px;\">\n                        <section\n                            style=\"flex: 1; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 3px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);\">\n                            <img src=\"https://picsum.photos/300/400?random=2\" alt=\"胡同紫藤\"\n                                style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; border-radius: 12px 12px 0 0;\">\n                            <section\n                                style=\"padding: 8px; font-size: 12px; color: #777; text-align: center; background: #f9f9f9;\">\n                                胡同紫藤花</section>\n                        </section>\n                        <section\n                            style=\"flex: 1; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 3px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);\">\n                            <img src=\"https://picsum.photos/300/400?random=3\" alt=\"春日花海\"\n                                style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; border-radius: 12px 12px 0 0;\">\n                            <section\n                                style=\"padding: 8px; font-size: 12px; color: #777; text-align: center; background: #f9f9f9;\">\n                                春花盛开</section>\n                        </section>\n                    </section>\n\n                    <p style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7; margin: 16px 0; text-indent: 2em; color: #555;\">\n                        胡同四合院的紫藤爬满老墙，老北京人的春日活动尽显烟火气。</p>\n                </section>\n\n                <section>\n                    <h4\n                        style=\"font-size: 19.2px; font-weight: 700; color: #444; margin: 24px 0 16px; border-bottom: 1px dashed #eee; padding-bottom: 8px;\">\n                        市井与繁花：烟火气里的春天</h4>\n                    <p style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7; margin: 0 0 16px; text-indent: 2em; color: #555;\">\n                        遛鸟、品茶，市井生活与繁花交织，构成独特的春日画卷。</p>\n                </section>\n            </section>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- 暮春的余韵 -->\n        <section\n            style=\"margin: 0 16px 32px; background-color: #fcfcfc; border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(216,140,154,0.08);\">\n            <section style=\"background-color: #e9f0f5; padding: 28.8px; border-radius: 16px 16px 0 0;\">\n                <h3\n                    style=\"font-size: 25.6px; font-weight: 800; margin: 0; color: #333; display: flex; align-items: center;\">\n                    <span\n                        style=\"display: inline-block; width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; background-color: #7b98b2; margin-right: 12.8px; flex-shrink: 0; color: white; font-size: 16px; text-align: center; line-height: 30px;\">3</span>\n                    暮春的余韵\n                </h3>\n                <p style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #666; margin: 8px 0 0 41.6px; font-style: italic;\">The Last Whisper of\n                    Spring</p>\n            </section>\n\n            <section style=\"padding: 24px; background: white;\">\n                <h4\n                    style=\"font-size: 19.2px; font-weight: 700; color: #444; margin: 0 0 16px; border-bottom: 1px dashed #eee; padding-bottom: 8px;\">\n                    柳絮与晚霞：春天最后的温柔</h4>\n\n                <p style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7; margin: 0 0 16px; text-indent: 2em; color: #555;\">\n                    奥森公园的落英缤纷，胡同里的柳絮纷飞。立夏前的雷雨与晚霞，为春天画上浪漫句点。</p>\n\n                <section\n                    style=\"margin: 24px 0; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);\">\n                    <img src=\"https://picsum.photos/600/350?random=4\" alt=\"北京暮春景色\"\n                        style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; border-radius: 12px;\">\n                    <section\n                        style=\"padding: 12.8px; background: #f9f9f9; font-size: 13.6px; color: #777; text-align: center;\">\n                        立夏前的北京晚霞（4月下旬）</section>\n                </section>\n            </section>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- 结语部分 -->\n        <section\n            style=\"padding: 32px 24px 48px; margin: 0 16px 32px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #d9e4f5 0%, #f5e3e6 100%); border-radius: 16px; box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);\">\n            <h3 style=\"font-size: 22.4px; font-weight: 700; color: #333; margin: 0 0 24px; text-align: center;\">\n                结语：从春天到夏天的期待</h3>\n\n            <p\n                style=\"font-size: 16.8px; line-height: 1.8; color: #444; margin: 0 0 24px; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">\n                66张照片，记录下北京春天短暂而珍贵的美丽。期待夏日的绿荫荷风，继续书写这座城市的四季故事。</p>\n\n            <section style=\"display: flex; justify-content: center; margin-top: 32px;\">\n                <section style=\"display: inline-flex; gap: 12.8px;\">\n                    <span\n                        style=\"background: #d88c9a; color: white; padding: 8px 16px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 14.4px; font-weight: 500;\">#北京春天记忆</span>\n                    <span\n                        style=\"background: #7b98b2; color: white; padding: 8px 16px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 14.4px; font-weight: 500;\">#立夏时节</span>\n                    <span\n                        style=\"background: #333; color: white; padding: 8px 16px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 14.4px; font-weight: 500;\">#城市影像</span>\n                </section>\n            </section>\n\n            <section style=\"margin-top: 32px; text-align: center;\">\n                <svg width=\"120\" height=\"30\" viewBox=\"0 0 120 30\">\n                    <path d=\"M10,15 L110,15\" stroke=\"#777\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"1,3\" />\n                    <text x=\"60\" y=\"25\" font-family=\"'PingFang SC'\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#777\" text-anchor=\"middle\">END\n                        OF SPRING</text>\n                </svg>\n            </section>\n        </section>\n    </section>\n</body>\n\n</html>"
  },
  "html": "<section style=\"box-sizing: border-box\" id=\"cw-layout-imported\"><section style=\"background: linear-gradient(to bottom, #f9f9f9, #ffffff); box-sizing: border-box; color: #333; font-family: 'PingFang SC', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0; max-width: 100%; overflow-x: hidden; padding: 0\"><section style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgb(245, 227, 230) 0%, rgb(217, 228, 245) 100%); box-sizing: border-box; display: block; padding: 32px; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\"><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-size: 16px; font-weight: 300; letter-spacing: 1px; overflow-wrap: anywhere; text-indent: 0px; width: 100%; margin-top: 0px;\">开场第一段：比赛结束后，人们先看到了比分。阅读一篇文章，也需要先交代背景，让读者知道事情从哪里开始。</p></section><section style=\"background-color: #fff; border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.08); border-radius: 20px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 40px 24px\"><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #444; font-size: 16.8px; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0 0 16px; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em\">开场第二段：比分接近，真正需要讨论的是关键时刻的判断。连续的正文应留在同一个阅读容器里，左右都应有清楚的留白。</p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #444; font-size: 16.8px; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0 0 16px; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em\">开场第三段：接下来再进入具体章节。段落数量改变时，不应丢失内容，不应贴边，也不应为每段重复一层巨大的卡片内边距。</p></section><section><p style=\"border-radius: 12px; box-sizing: border-box; color: #555; display: block; font-size: 16px; height: auto; line-height: 1.7; margin: 0 0 16px; max-width: 100%; text-indent: 2em; width: 100%\"><img src=\"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/wendao-ai/wendao-ai-template-market/raw/sample-images/reading-still-life.jpg?ref=master&v=0537832c544b1da46e9132fbf0b360b50d94e840b6077ec13a6f57c5c0ab925c\" alt=\"自然光下的阅读与写作静物\" style=\"display: block; height: auto; margin: 16px 0; max-width: 100%; width: 100%\"></p></section><section style=\"background-color: #fff; border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.08); border-radius: 20px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 40px 24px\"><h2 style=\"border-left: 4px solid #d88c9a; box-sizing: border-box; color: #333; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 16px; overflow-wrap: anywhere; padding-left: 12.8px; text-indent: 0\">从标题开始，建立阅读节奏</h2><section><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #444; font-size: 16.8px; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0 0 16px; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em\">标题需要一个清楚的重心。<strong>重点句只强调一次</strong>，其余正文让段落长度、行距和留白承担节奏。</p></section><section><blockquote style=\"border-left: 3px solid #94a3b8; margin: 18px 0; padding: 12px 16px\"><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #555; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7; margin: 0 0 16px; text-indent: 2em\">排版的任务，是把内容的关系呈现出来。</p></blockquote></section><section><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #444; font-size: 16.8px; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0 0 16px; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em\">每种风格都应该有自己的声音，同时让正文保持完整、清楚和可读。</p></section></section><section style=\"background-color: #fcfcfc; border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.08); border-radius: 16px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0 16px 32px\"><section style=\"background-color: #f0f5fa; border-radius: 16px 16px 0 0; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 28.8px\"><h2 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #333; display: block; font-size: 25.6px; font-weight: 800; margin: 0; overflow-wrap: anywhere; text-indent: 0\">三个可以马上检查的地方</h2></section><section><ul style=\"color: #666\"><li>标题是否有独立的视觉重心</li><li>章节之间是否留出呼吸空间</li><li>重点是否与普通正文形成清楚层级</li></ul></section><section><p style=\"border-radius: 12px; box-sizing: border-box; color: #555; display: block; font-size: 16px; height: auto; line-height: 1.7; margin: 0 0 16px; max-width: 100%; text-indent: 2em; width: 100%\"><img src=\"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/wendao-ai/wendao-ai-template-market/raw/sample-images/reading-still-life.jpg?ref=master&v=0537832c544b1da46e9132fbf0b360b50d94e840b6077ec13a6f57c5c0ab925c\" alt=\"自然光下的阅读与写作静物\" style=\"display: block; height: auto; margin: 16px 0; max-width: 100%; width: 100%\"></p></section><section><p style=\"border-radius: 12px; box-sizing: border-box; color: #555; display: block; font-size: 16px; height: auto; line-height: 1.7; margin: 0 0 16px; max-width: 100%; text-indent: 2em; width: 100%\"><img src=\"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/wendao-ai/wendao-ai-template-market/raw/sample-images/reading-still-life.jpg?ref=master&v=0537832c544b1da46e9132fbf0b360b50d94e840b6077ec13a6f57c5c0ab925c\" alt=\"自然光下的阅读与写作静物\" style=\"display: block; height: auto; margin: 16px 0; max-width: 100%; width: 100%\"></p></section><section><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; color: #666; margin: 18px 0; table-layout: fixed; width: 100%\"><thead><tr><th style=\"border: 1px solid #d8dee5; overflow-wrap: anywhere; padding: 8px\">检查项</th><th style=\"border: 1px solid #d8dee5; overflow-wrap: anywhere; padding: 8px\">观察方式</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #d8dee5; overflow-wrap: anywhere; padding: 8px\">标题</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #d8dee5; overflow-wrap: anywhere; padding: 8px\">第一眼能否找到主题</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #d8dee5; overflow-wrap: anywhere; padding: 8px\">正文</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #d8dee5; overflow-wrap: anywhere; padding: 8px\">是否能够连续阅读</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #d8dee5; overflow-wrap: anywhere; padding: 8px\">引用</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #d8dee5; overflow-wrap: anywhere; padding: 8px\">是否与作者叙述区分</td></tr></tbody></table></section><section><p style=\"border-radius: 12px; box-sizing: border-box; color: #555; display: block; font-size: 16px; height: auto; line-height: 1.7; margin: 0 0 16px; max-width: 100%; text-indent: 2em; width: 100%\"><img src=\"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/wendao-ai/wendao-ai-template-market/raw/sample-images/reading-still-life.jpg?ref=master&v=0537832c544b1da46e9132fbf0b360b50d94e840b6077ec13a6f57c5c0ab925c\" alt=\"自然光下的阅读与写作静物\" style=\"display: block; height: auto; margin: 16px 0; max-width: 100%; width: 100%\"></p></section></section><section style=\"background-color: #fcfcfc; border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.08); border-radius: 16px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0 16px 32px\"><section style=\"background-color: #f5e6e9; border-radius: 16px 16px 0 0; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 28.8px\"><h2 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #333; display: block; font-size: 25.6px; font-weight: 800; margin: 0; overflow-wrap: anywhere; text-indent: 0\">把风格落实到每一个细节</h2></section><section style=\"background-color: #f5e6e9; border-radius: 16px 16px 0 0; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 28.8px\"><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #666; font-size: 16px; font-style: italic; line-height: 1.7; margin: 8px 0 0 41.6px; text-indent: 2em\">报纸用硬边栏线建立秩序，杂志用大留白放慢速度，信笺让段落像一次自然的交谈。</p></section><section><p style=\"border-radius: 12px; box-sizing: border-box; color: #555; display: block; font-size: 16px; height: auto; line-height: 1.7; margin: 0 0 16px; max-width: 100%; text-indent: 2em; width: 100%\"><img src=\"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/wendao-ai/wendao-ai-template-market/raw/sample-images/reading-still-life.jpg?ref=master&v=0537832c544b1da46e9132fbf0b360b50d94e840b6077ec13a6f57c5c0ab925c\" alt=\"自然光下的阅读与写作静物\" style=\"display: block; height: auto; margin: 16px 0; max-width: 100%; width: 100%\"></p></section><section style=\"background-color: #f5e6e9; border-radius: 16px 16px 0 0; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 28.8px\"><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #666; font-size: 16px; font-style: italic; line-height: 1.7; margin: 8px 0 0 41.6px; text-indent: 2em\">一个完整的句子，不应该为了装饰被删掉。一张原有的表格，也不应该被换成没有事实来源的数字。</p></section><section style=\"background-color: #f5e6e9; border-radius: 16px 16px 0 0; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 28.8px\"><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #666; font-size: 16px; font-style: italic; line-height: 1.7; margin: 8px 0 0 41.6px; text-indent: 2em\">读完之后，留下一个清楚的观点，比留下许多重复的色块更有价值。</p></section></section></section></section>",
